      "chunk_id": "sha256:662d417279acbdb5f3ff927bd2599bdb2510d03751cd61ec7286c6a88102bb4f",
      "quote": "Set the parameters of this estimator."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "sha256:c245a5f893c29b17cb67e73206c282d8e0423a69bbf6370e33334472c9bc6f0e",
      "quote": "For this, it enables setting parameters of the various steps using their names and the parameter name separated by a '__' , as in the example below."
    }
  ],
  "decision": "answer",
  "answer": "Use the set_params method with the parameter name in the format 'svc__C=10' to set the C parameter of the svc step to 10.",
  "abstention_reason": ""
